BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 586.89 Tm (Cardiovascular autonomic dysfunction and cardiac arrhythmias represent leading global healthcare burdens.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 574.89 Tm (While traditional 12-lead Electrocardiography \(ECG\) remains the clinical gold standard, its reliance on adhesive electrodes) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 562.89 Tm (and specialized analog instrumentation prevents continuous, frictionless everyday monitoring. This capstone engineering) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 550.89 Tm (thesis proposes a complete Cyber-Physical Digital Twin software system implemented on standard consumer smartphones.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 532.89 Tm (The project introduces a dual-modal mobile acquisition framework eliminating all external hardware requirements:) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 520.89 Tm (  - Primary Optical Contact PPG: 60 FPS camera video tracking capillary blood volume pulse illuminated by the LED flash.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 508.89 Tm (  - Secondary Mechanical Chest SCG: 100 Hz 3-axis MEMS accelerometer recording sternal cardiac recoil micro-vibrations.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 496.89 Tm (The extracted signals are conditioned using digital Butterworth filtering, processed via adaptive systolic peak detection,) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 484.89 Tm (and converted to Pulse Rate Variability \(PRV\) biomarkers. A trained machine learning classifier predicts sympathovagal) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.50 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 472.89 Tm (stress and arrhythmia risk, which parameterizes a coupled nonlinear oscillator simulating rhythm breakdown under stress.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica-Bold 11.00 Tf 0.060 0.090 0.160 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 448.89 Tm (2. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & 4-STAGE PIPELINE CONTRACTS) Tj ET
