BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 739.89 Tm (1. Optical Camera Pipeline: Flutter/React Native native bridge capturing uncompressed video frames at 60 FPS.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 728.89 Tm (   Locking exposure duration and ISO sensitivity while activating the rear torch LED to ensure constant skin illumination.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 717.89 Tm (2. Spatial Region of Interest \(ROI\): Extracting a centered 120x120 pixel bounding box from each frame and calculating the) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 706.89 Tm (   mean green channel intensity:  I_G\(t\) = \(1 / |ROI|\) * sum\(Pixel_G\(x, y, t\)\).) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 695.89 Tm (3. Contact Verification Heuristic: Analyzing the Red/Green channel ratio. Human fingertip transillumination exhibits) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 684.89 Tm (   I_R / I_G >= 1.8. If the ratio drops, the system triggers a visual prompt notifying the user of poor optical contact.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 673.89 Tm (4. Sternal SCG Acceleration: Concurrently polling the device 3-axis accelerometer at 100 Hz via SENSOR_DELAY_FASTEST.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 662.89 Tm (   Extracting the dorso-ventral axis \(a_z\) representing perpendicular sternal recoil micro-displacements.) Tj ET
