BT /Helvetica-Bold 9.50 Tf 0.920 0.350 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 631.89 Tm (STAGE 2 \(MEMBER B -- YOUR ROLE\): DIGITAL SIGNAL PROCESSING & PRV ENGINE) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 617.89 Tm (As Member B, your responsibilities form the mathematical and signal processing foundation of the capstone thesis:) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 607.39 Tm () Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 596.89 Tm (A. Zero-Phase Digital Bandpass Filtering:) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 586.39 Tm (   - PPG Channel: 4th-order zero-phase Butterworth bandpass filter \(0.5 Hz - 5.0 Hz, corresponding to 30 - 300 bpm\).) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 575.89 Tm (     Removes low-frequency baseline drift \(respiration, finger pressure\) and high-frequency CMOS sensor noise.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 565.39 Tm (   - SCG Channel: 4th-order Butterworth bandpass filter \(1.0 Hz - 20.0 Hz\). Eliminates large thoracic respiratory) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 554.89 Tm (     excursions \(0.1 - 0.4 Hz\) to isolate aortic valve opening \(AO\) and rapid ventricular ejection \(RE\) micro-vibrations.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 544.39 Tm () Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 533.89 Tm (B. Adaptive Systolic Peak Detection & Outlier Rejection:) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 523.39 Tm (   - Computes numerical gradient / derivative to amplify the rapid systolic upslope.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 512.89 Tm (   - Implements adaptive dual-thresholding with a 250 ms physiological blanking refractory period to prevent false) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 502.39 Tm (     detection of dicrotic notches or reflected peripheral waves.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 491.89 Tm (   - Produces the discrete Peak-to-Peak Interval series: PPI[i] = t_peak[i] - t_peak[i-1] in milliseconds.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 481.39 Tm (   - Applies ectopic beat filtering: rejecting non-physiological intervals outside the 300 ms - 1800 ms window.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 470.89 Tm () Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 460.39 Tm (C. Clinical Pulse Rate Variability \(PRV\) Feature Extraction:) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 449.89 Tm (   - Time-Domain Metrics: Mean Heart Rate \(bpm\), SDNN \(overall autonomic variability\), RMSSD \(parasympathetic) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 439.39 Tm (     vagal tone: sqrt\(mean\(diff\(PPI\)^2\)\)\), and pNN50 \(% of successive intervals differing by > 50 ms\).) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 428.89 Tm (   - Frequency-Domain Spectral Analysis \(FFT\): Uneven PPI series are resampled to 4.0 Hz via cubic spline interpolation.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 418.39 Tm (     Power Spectral Density \(PSD\) is estimated via Welch's periodogram, integrating specific clinical bands:) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 407.89 Tm (       - Low-Frequency \(LF: 0.04 - 0.15 Hz\): Sympathetic & baroreflex modulation.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 397.39 Tm (       - High-Frequency \(HF: 0.15 - 0.40 Hz\): Parasympathetic vagal tone \(respiratory sinus arrhythmia\).) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 386.89 Tm (       - LF/HF Ratio: The gold-standard clinical index of sympathovagal autonomic balance and acute stress.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica-Bold 9.50 Tf 0.100 0.150 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 151.39 Tm (STAGE 3 \(MEMBER C\): DUAL-TARGET MACHINE LEARNING RISK PROFILING) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 137.39 Tm (1. Training Benchmarks: Utilizing WESAD \(Wearable Stress and Affect Detection\) and CapnoBase/MIMIC-III PPG benchmarks.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 126.39 Tm (2. Dual-Target Formulation:) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 115.39 Tm (   - Target 1 \(Autonomic Stress\): Binary/3-class classifier \(Baseline Rest vs. Cognitive/Physical Stress\).) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 104.39 Tm (   - Target 2 \(Arrhythmia Screening\): Regular Sinus Rhythm vs. Pulse Irregularity / Atrial Fibrillation.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 93.39 Tm (3. Algorithms & Rigor: Random Forest, Gradient Boosted Trees \(XGBoost\), and Logistic Regression evaluated via) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 8.00 Tf 0.200 0.250 0.300 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 82.39 Tm (   Leave-One-Subject-Out \(LOSO\) cross-validation to strictly prevent patient data leakage. SHAP values explain features.) Tj ET
