BT /Helvetica-Bold 8.00 Tf 0.060 0.090 0.160 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 637.89 Tm (Q1: 'Commercial smartphone apps already measure heart rate. What is your novel engineering contribution?') Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.300 0.350 0.400 rg 1 0 0 1 55.00 627.89 Tm (A1: Commercial mobile apps are closed-source commercial utilities that output a single coarse number \(heart rate bpm\)) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.300 0.350 0.400 rg 1 0 0 1 55.00 618.39 Tm (using black-box filters. Our thesis develops a fully transparent, white-box pipeline extracting clinical Pulse Rate) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.300 0.350 0.400 rg 1 0 0 1 55.00 608.89 Tm (Variability \(PRV\) spectral densities, pairs it with an explainable ML autonomic risk classifier, and drives a real-time) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.300 0.350 0.400 rg 1 0 0 1 55.00 599.39 Tm (nonlinear cardiac dynamical digital twin to simulate physiological stress collapse. No commercial app does this.) Tj ET
